<Base title="About" description="Love You Forever is a daily memorial for women across Italy, written with care from published sources." path="/about/">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>About Love You Forever</h1>
    <p class="lede">A daily place to remember women across Italy by name, and to let the example of each life reach the world.</p>
    <h2>What this site is</h2>
    <p>Every day, women across Italy are loved by their families and communities, yet many of their names appear in the news for only a few hours before the world moves on. Love You Forever gives each one a calm page of her own, with her name, her town and what trusted sources have shared about her life.</p>
    <h2>How we write</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We use only what published sources say about her life. We never invent qualities, stories or quotes.</li>
      <li>When little is known, we say so simply and keep her in our thoughts.</li>
      <li>We do not describe how her life ended, we do not name or point at anyone, and we do not publish photographs of her.</li>
      <li>When a name has not been widely published, we respect that and write about "a woman" or "a mother" from her town.</li>
      <li>Every page names the published sources it draws on. Relatives or readers who want to check a detail can ask us for the original source.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Who runs it</h2>
    <p>Love You Forever is edited by Adeo Patapo of Patapo AI. Each day's pages are prepared with the help of AI tools and reviewed by the editor before they are published.</p>
    <h2>Corrections and removal</h2>
    <p>If you are a relative or friend, or if we got something wrong, please <a href="/corrections/">tell us</a>. We answer family requests first.</p>
    <div class="help"><strong>If you need help.</strong> If you are a woman experiencing violence or stalking in Italy, call 1522. It is free, open 24 hours a day and available in several languages, including English. In an emergency, call 112.</div>
  </div>
</Base>
